        "How did the bank achieve its sub-30% Cost-to-Income ratio in 2025?|By migrating 94% of routine retail transactions and SME loan renewals to its mobile banking application|By closing all its branches and firing half the staff|By doubling loan interest rates|By stopping all marketing",
